n></p></div><div begin="39.250" end="42.457" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="39.250" end="42.457" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.250" end="39.635">He</span> <span begin="39.635" end="40.139">told</span> <span begin="40.139" end="40.581">me,</span> <span begin="40.581" end="41.090">&quot;Please</span> <span begin="41.090" end="41.521">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="41.521" end="42.016">wor</span><span begin="42.016" end="42.457">ry&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他告诉我 不必担心</span></p></div><div begin="42.457" end="46.303" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="42.457" end="46.303" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.457" end="43.010">Wise</span> <span begin="43.010" end="43.144">lit</span><span begin="43.144" end="43.243">tle</span> <span begin="43.243" end="43.925">smile</span> <span begin="43.925" end="44.081">that</span> <span begin="44.081" end="44.730">spoke</span> <span begin="44.730" end="45.105">so</span> <span begin="45.105" end="45.751">safe</span><span begin="45.751" end="46.303">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他脸上明智的微笑让我安心</span></p></div><div begin="46.748" end="50.182" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="46.748" end="50.182" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.748" end="47.149">He</span> <span begin="47.149" end="47.566">booked</span> <span begin="47.566" end="48.085">a</span> <span begin="48.085" end="48.561">one-</span><span begin="48.561" end="49.034">way</span> <span begin="49.034" end="49.485">tick</span><span begin="49.485" end="50.182">et</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他买了张单程的车票</span></p></div><div begin="50.470" end="53.910" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="50.470" end="53.910" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.470" end="50.888">Out</span> <span begin="50.888" end="51.458">West,</span> <span begin="51.458" end="51.825">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="51.825" end="52.320">where</span> <span begin="52.320" end="52.767">they</span> <span begin="52.767" end="53.242">make</span> <span begin="53.242" end="53.910">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">西去好莱坞 那里才能出人头地</span></p></div><div begin="53.910" end="57.643" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="53.910" end="57.643" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.178" end="54.632">Six</span> <span begin="54.632" end="54.998">kids</span> <span begin="54.998" end="55.552">stuck</span> <span begin="55.552" end="56.028">in</span> <span begin="56.028" end="56.517">a</span> <span begin="56.517" end="56.828">bed</span><span begin="56.828" end="57.643">sit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">六个孩子蜗居一室</span></p></div><div begin="57.944" end="1:02.377" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="57.944" end="1:02.377" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.944" end="58.209">To</span> <span begin="58.209" end="58.758">sun</span> <span begin="58.758" end="59.333">swept</span> <span begin="59.333" end="59.714">pool</span><span begin="59.714" end="1:00.266">side</span> <span begin="1:00.266" end="1:00.631">rich</span><span begin="1:00.631" end="1:02.377">es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">向往着阳光普照的泳池畔的富贵生活</span></p></div><div begin="1:04.502" end="1:08.478" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:04.502" end="1:08.478" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:04.502" end="1:04.715">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:08.246" end="1:08.478">oh</span></p></div><div begin="1:08.672" end="1:12.414" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:08.672" end="1:12.414" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.672" end="1:09.188">He</span> <span begin="1:09.188" end="1:09.401">met</span> <span begin="1:09.401" end="1:09.626">a</span> <span begin="1:09.626" end="1:10.093">girl</span> <span begin="1:10.093" end="1:10.571">who</span> <span begin="1:10.571" end="1:11.006">wore</span> <span begin="1:11.006" end="1:11.285">Ver</span><span begin="1:11.285" end="1:11.908">sa</span><span begin="1:11.908" end="1:12.414">ce<